        "book": "Mosiah",
        "chapter": 22,
        "verse": 7
      },
      {
        "text": "Thus we will depart with our women and our children, our flocks, and our herds into the wilderness; and we will travel around the land of Shilom.",
        "footNotes": [
          {
            "start": 138,
            "end": 144,
            "text": "Mosiah 7:7 (5–16)."
          }
        ],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 8,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Mosiah 22:8",
        "book": "Mosiah",
        "chapter": 22,
        "verse": 8
      },
      {
        "text": "And it came to pass that the king hearkened unto the words of Gideon.",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 9,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Mosiah 22:9",
        "book": "Mosiah",
        "chapter": 22,
        "verse": 9
      },
      {
        "text": "And king Limhi caused that his people should gather their flocks together; and he sent the tribute of wine to the Lamanites; and he also sent more wine, as a present unto them; and they did drink freely of the wine which king Limhi did send unto them.",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 10,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Mosiah 22:10",
        "book": "Mosiah",
        "chapter": 22,
        "verse": 10
      },
      {
        "text": "And it came to pass that the people of king Limhi did depart by night into the wilderness with their flocks and their herds, and they went round about the land of Shilom in the wilderness, and bent their course towards the land of Zarahemla, being led by Ammon and his brethren.",
        "footNotes": [
          {
            "start": 54,
            "end": 60,
            "text": "Mosiah 25:8."
          },
          {
            "start": 163,
            "end": 169,
            "text": "Mosiah 11:12 (12–13); Alma 23:12."
          }
        ],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 11,
        "crossReferences": [
          {
